    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Community</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139560/extras/3e810170abe4c98722b7c9b53ebe755f.webp?t=1729000620\" width=201 height=40 /></span><br>Number of Everything features constant and countless updates about [Everything]. Please consider joining the community for the latest updates and discussing with players and developers.<br>Discord: <br><span class=\"bb_spoiler\">The second theme can be discovered in the Demo by typing in [SECRET CODE] found in the community. </span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139560/extras/df0e8fd189c3ae1853f8d458a3901144.webp?t=1729000620\" width=200 height=40 /></span><br>Numbers of Everything is literally about [Everything] in our daily life. Clock, coin, and many others, they are all very familiar in our daily life. We have stopped observing and thinking about them. The game borrows these \u201csmall\u201d and daily objects as starting points to discuss \u201cbig\u201d and abstract questions, like time, past, and emotions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139560/extras/1fda9512a231388def26d9356f824a84.webp?t=1729000620\" width=200 height=40 /></span><br>Numbers of Everything is a puzzle game in the format of numeric manipulations. Math is hard, but don't panic! The game features many many entry levels that are very friendly to beginners until you feel ready to step up. It also equips the player with modern technology that enabling retry, rewind.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139560/extras/67be5a76f97b6974ca863ca8ae927a03.webp?t=1729000620\" width=200 height=40 /></span><br>There are hidden gems inside the game across everywhere. Awaiting to be found and collected.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139560/extras/9a6b9e474cf80907d5847300e0469454.webp?t=1729000620\" width=200 height=40 /></span><br>This is my second personal game. I feel thankful and connected to everyone who has played it. There is a lot to be communicated but allow me sometime to organize my feelings.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139560/extras/df0e8fd189c3ae1853f8d458a3901144.webp?t=1729000620\" width=200 height=40 /></span><br>Numbers of Everything is literally about [Everything] in our daily life. Clock, coin, and many others, they are all very familiar in our daily life. We have stopped observing and thinking about them. The game borrows these \u201csmall\u201d and daily objects as starting points to discuss \u201cbig\u201d and abstract questions, like time, past, and emotions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139560/extras/1fda9512a231388def26d9356f824a84.webp?t=1729000620\" width=200 height=40 /></span><br>Numbers of Everything is a puzzle game in the format of numeric manipulations. Math is hard, but don't panic! The game features many many entry levels that are very friendly to beginners until you feel ready to step up. It also equips the player with modern technology that enabling retry, rewind.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139560/extras/67be5a76f97b6974ca863ca8ae927a03.webp?t=1729000620\" width=200 height=40 /></span><br>There are hidden gems inside the game across everywhere. Awaiting to be found and collected.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139560/extras/9a6b9e474cf80907d5847300e0469454.webp?t=1729000620\" width=200 height=40 /></span><br>This is my second personal game. I feel thankful and connected to everyone who has played it. There is a lot to be communicated but allow me sometime to organize my feelings.",
    "short_description": "Numbers of Everything interprets common objects/concepts in everyday life from unique perspectives. These perspectives are then mashed into puzzles based on numerical manipulations. Let\u2019s talk about cats, work, time, and everything by playing puzzles.",
